  "typeCharacter": "Fraunces at a soft, generous weight (600) in sentence case gives the warm, slightly old-fashioned inn voice: the hero headline runs very large (around 6vw), dish names sit at roughly 3.5vw on the dark sections and the terrace number is set at 12vw in gold. Source Sans 3 at regular weight, 18–19px with relaxed leading, carries all running text, hours and menu descriptions, so no labels are tracked or set in capitals.",
  "composition": "Hero on deep green #16301f: a small Fraunces wordmark 'Pri Zlati Žlici' at top left (columns 1–3) and a short text nav on the right. Columns 1–6 hold the h1 in #eef2e8, the lead in #b9c7b0 and one gold #e0b04a button with softly squared corners and dark green text. Columns 7–12 hold img_01, the façade with the linden, masked with a tall round-arched top like the inn's doorway, bleeding off the right and bottom edges of the screen. A small gold line drawing of a spoon resting on a linden sprig sits under the button. Section 2, 'Malica in nedeljsko kosilo', on the light linden band #f2f6ee: columns 1–6 hold two menu entries separated by thin #1c2a1f rules, each a Fraunces title over a Source Sans description. In columns 8–12 img_03, the buckwheat žganci, is cropped to a circle following the plate and bled to the right edge. Section 3, 'Z jedilnega lista', back on deep green: img_04, the štruklji, sits in columns 1–5 with one cut corner. Columns 7–12 list the dish names stacked as large Fraunces lines in #eef2e8 divided by #3b5a44 rules, with the short text below in #b9c7b0. Section 4, the terrace, on surface green #20402b: the numeral 40 in gold Fraunces at 12vw spans columns 1–5, with 'sedežev na terasi pod lipo' set beside it. Columns 7–12 hold the running text about summer and group bookings, and a fine gold linden-leaf drawing sits at the far right. Section 5, team, on the light band: img_02, the dining room with the green tiled stove, bleeds off the left edge across columns 1–7 with square corners. Columns 8–12 hold 'Tretja generacija družine Bizjak' in large Fraunces in #1c2a1f and a short paragraph. Section 6, 'Rezervacije', on deep green: the phone as a large gold numeral across columns 1–6 with email below. Columns 7–9 hold opening hours as a compact table in #eef2e8 with #3b5a44 rules, and columns 10–12 hold the address over a simple schematic line map of Kapucinski trg in #b9c7b0 lines with a small geranium-red #b5462e dot. A thin footer closes the page.",
  "imagery": "All four client photos are used as the inn's own pictures. img_01 (façade and linden) appears as the tall arched hero image bled to the right edge. img_03 (žganci) is a circle crop on the light band. img_04 (štruklji) gets one cut corner on deep green. img_02 (dining room with the tiled stove) is bled off the left edge in the team section. Two small drawn pieces in a single fine gold #e0b04a ink line on the flat deep-green ground, kept apart from all text: a spoon lying on a linden sprig with three heart-shaped leaves (hero), and a single linden leaf with its pale bract (terrace section). The drawings contain no letters, hands or buildings.",
  "signature": "The façade with its linden rises in a tall round arch like the inn's own doorway, cut into a shutter-green page, and later the forty seats under that tree return as a huge gold 40.",
  "copy": {
    "headline": "Domače jedi pod lipo na Kapucinskem trgu",
    "lead": "Družinska gostilna v starem delu Škofje Loke, ki jo vodi tretja generacija družine Bizjak. Kuhamo ajdove žgance, obaro in štruklje iz sestavin lokalnih kmetov."
  },
  "imagePrompt": "One flat full-page screenshot of a desktop restaurant homepage, 1536×1024 px, no browser window, no device frame, no perspective, straight-on. Overall palette: deep shutter green #16301f page ground, a slightly lighter green #20402b for one section, a very light cool linden-green band #f2f6ee for alternating sections (clearly greenish-white, not cream), text in soft light green-white #eef2e8 on dark and #1c2a1f on light, muted text #b9c7b0, one warm gold #e0b04a as the only strong accent, thin rules in #3b5a44, and a tiny geranium red #b5462e dot used once. Typography: Fraunces serif for all headings, soft and generous at semibold weight, sentence case, very large. Source Sans 3 for body text, regular, comfortable leading. No uppercase tracked labels, no italic words, no numbered section labels, no gradients, no shadows, nothing centred. Layout on a 12-column grid, top to bottom. 1) Hero on #16301f: small Fraunces wordmark top left and a short text navigation top right in #b9c7b0. Left half (columns 1–6): a huge Fraunces headline in #eef2e8 over three lines, a lead paragraph in #b9c7b0, and a single gold #e0b04a button with slightly rounded rectangular corners (not pill-shaped) and dark green text. Below it, a small fine gold line drawing of a spoon resting on a linden sprig with heart-shaped leaves on the plain green ground. Right half (columns 7–12): the attached photo of the white inn façade with green shutters and the big linden tree, masked in a tall round-topped arch like a doorway, bleeding off the right and bottom edges. 2) Light band #f2f6ee: on the left, two menu entries with Fraunces titles and short sans descriptions separated by thin dark rules. On the right, the attached photo of buckwheat žganci with cracklings cropped to a circle around the plate, bleeding off the right edge. 3) Deep green #16301f: on the left, the attached photo of walnut štruklji on a white plate with one cut corner. On the right, a stacked list of dish names in large Fraunces #eef2e8 lines divided by thin #3b5a44 rules, with a short paragraph below in #b9c7b0. 4) Section on #20402b: an enormous gold Fraunces numeral 40 on the left with a short phrase beside it, running text on the right in #b9c7b0, and a single fine gold line drawing of a linden leaf with its bract on the plain ground at the far right. 5) Light band #f2f6ee: the attached photo of the wooden dining room with white tablecloths and the green tiled stove, bleeding off the left edge across the left seven columns. On the right, a large dark Fraunces heading and a short paragraph. 6) Contact on #16301f: on the left, the phone number as a large gold Fraunces numeral with the email below. In the middle, opening hours as a compact table with thin rules. On the right, the address above a simple schematic line map in #b9c7b0 with a small red #b5462e dot. Then a thin footer line. Use only the four attached photographs as the site's photos, recognisable and cropped as described; no other photos, no people, no faces."
}

